[1029,4,1,1945,"Survivors at Ebensee","In May 1945, American troops liberated Ebensee, a Nazi concentration camp in Austria. The survivors in this photograph stare at the camera. Pictures like this showed the world what had happened and are kept as evidence so it is never forgotten.","Why is it important to remember difficult history?"],
